#* {{quote-journal|en|date=2021-06-24|author=Johnny Luk|section=Opinion|title=Why ‘woke’ became toxic|journal=w:Al Jazeera|url=https://www.aljazeera.com/opinions/2021/6/24/what-is-woke-culture-and-why-has-it-become-so-toxic
|passage=The famous author of Harry Potter, J K Rowling, found herself at the centre of a '''woke''' storm after liking a tweet by Maya Forstater, who lost her job in 2019 after tweeting that “male people are not women”. The reaction was immediate, with some accusing Forstater of “killing trans people with her hate” for simply expressing an opinion.}}
